{"id":"schrecken","lemma":"Schrecken","pos":"noun","rank":3440,"glosses":["fright","terror"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/09/De-Schrecken.ogg/De-Schrecken.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schreckens","plural":"Schrecken"},"examples":[{"text":"Alle kamen mit dem Schrecken davon.","en":"Everyone escaped injury.","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"from it"}]},{"text":"Sie wurde bleich vor Schrecken.","en":"She turned pale with fear.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"pale, pallid"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null]},{"text":"Deine Schreie versetzten mich in Angst und Schrecken.","en":"Your screams frightened me.","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},{"g":"shout, cry, scream","l":"Schrei"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Tom sah von Schrecken erfüllt aus.","en":"Tom looked horrified.","words":[null,{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"from / of"},null,{"g":"to fill","l":"erfüllen"},{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Zu meinem Schrecken stellte ich fest, dass ich mein Geld verloren hatte.","en":"To my dismay, I found I had lost my money.","words":[{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to pose, to lodge","l":"stellen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"firm"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"lost, missing"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"}]}]}